Periodic Table 2002 recomp

The host is derived from the AmazingMIDI recomp's host (itself from the
MechWarrior 3 recomp) and runs on pcrecomp's native32 runtime
(https://github.com/sp00nznet/pcrecomp); the lift driver is AmazingMIDI's
(from the Bully recomp's). tools/rp.py is the Retail Plus Lite
recomp's. All MIT.

